  <p id="c-nanshi-013-wangzhenfeng-liuchuo:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-013-wangzhenfeng-liuchuo:p001:m0000" ref="ptn_sz3_vro">義慶</persName>在廣陵有疾，而白虹貫城，野麕入府，心甚惡之。因陳求還，文帝許解州，以本號還朝。二十一年，薨於都下，追贈司空，諡曰康王。子哀王<persName id="c-nanshi-013-wangzhenfeng-liuchuo:p001:m0064" ref="ptn_sz3_vro_B">曄</persName>嗣，為元凶所殺。<persName id="c-nanshi-013-wangzhenfeng-liuchuo:p001:m0073" ref="ptn_sz3_vro_B">曄</persName>子<persName id="c-nanshi-013-wangzhenfeng-liuchuo:p001:m0075" ref="ptn_sz3_vro_BA">綽</persName>嗣，升明三年見殺，國除。</p>
</text>
